    frame('mandy-learning','mandy','21 Oct 2026 · 17:20','Community visit · Thank you to the adult-learning group for an afternoon of practical questions. The bus-home question was better than anything on my prepared slide. The Learning Access draft is on the Capitol site.',['mandy-schmear-community'],[['coach','Please keep the rural transport question in the next draft.'],['dana','Evening options are useful only when families can plan around them.'],['ellis','And when the application fits the size of the organization.']]);
    frame('mandy-campaign','mandy','18 Oct 2026 · 14:10','Political advocacy · Community account. I am running for re-election against Leon Tusk in the November 3 fictional election, and I support assembly candidates who back evening learning access. This is a campaign-season message; official government notices live at the Capitol. My campaign account has the latest election updates.',['mandy-schmear-portrait'],[['corey','I like the goal. I want to see the transport budget before celebrating.'],['lena','Please keep the smaller community programs in the conversation.'],['sam','A proposal and a funded program are different stages.']]);
    frame('mandy-capitol','mandy','12 Oct 2026 · 09:15','A walk around the Capitol before the first meeting. The autumn leaves do not read the maintenance schedule. Mine is a public-service job; the best part is still listening to someone explain what their day actually looks like.',['capitol-autumn'],[['ellis','The old station photographs have the same trees at about half the size.']]);
    frame('ada-desk','ada','26 Oct 2026 · 10:10','A packet with dates on the attachments. Glamorous? No. Useful when three versions are circulating? Very. The corridor hearing is tomorrow at 5:30.',['ada-records'],[['ellis','The contents page deserves a small celebration.'],['sam','Please let that celebration include a version number.']]);
    frame('ada-weekend','ada','10 Oct 2026 · 16:25','Railway-history day. Came for the photographs, stayed for the handwritten catalogue. Tea afterward.',['ada-portrait'],[['ellis','An excellent itinerary.']]);
    frame('rowan-field','rowan','24 Oct 2026 · 15:15','Walked the local alternative again. A painted arrow cannot tell you whether a corner actually works on a bicycle. New road bulletin is up; the shoulder is still closed.',['rowan-walk'],[['corey','Appreciate the change after our conversation.'],['vera','Hope the replacement covers arrive when promised.']]);
